<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s15-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title"><view class="top-title-main">复查更新</view><view class="top-title-sub">蚊虫叮咬 · 第 1 次复查</view></view><view class="top-action" bindtap="saveDraft">保存草稿</view></view>
<view class="card card-pad row"><view class="circle circle-green" style="width:82rpx;height:82rpx">2h</view><view style="margin-left:24rpx"><view>距离首次记录约 2 小时</view><view class="tiny">只更新变化，不必重复填写全部信息</view></view></view>
<view class="section-title">现在和之前相比怎样？</view><view class="choice-grid"><view wx:for="{{trends}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{trend===item?'danger-active':''}}" data-v="{{item}}" bindtap="setTrend">{{item}}</view></view>
<view class="section-title"><text>当前表现</text><text class="aside">可多选</text></view><view class="chip-row"><view wx:for="{{symptomChoices}}" wx:key="label" class="chip {{item.selected?'danger-active':''}}" data-v="{{item.label}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.label}}</view></view>
<view class="section-title">范围变化</view><view class="choice-grid"><view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{range===item?'danger-active':''}}" data-v="{{item}}" bindtap="setRange">{{item}}</view></view>
<view class="card card-pad row" style="margin-top:44rpx" bindtap="photo"><image wx:if="{{photo}}" class="review-photo" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/><image wx:else class="photo-placeholder" src="/assets/figma/all/s15-imgFrame1.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="grow" style="margin-left:24rpx"><view>添加现在的照片</view><view class="tiny">用于与首次照片对照变化</view></view><text class="muted">添加</text></view>
<view class="notice notice-red" style="margin-top:38rpx"><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s15-img2.svg"/>若出现呼吸困难或意识异常<text class="block-break"></text>立即中断复查并紧急求助</view><button class="primary-btn" style="margin-top:38rpx" bindtap="save">重新评估并保存</button><view class="safe-note" style="margin-top:20rpx">首次结果会保留，系统不会直接覆盖历史记录</view></view>
